ing careers. 333 ore units are needed for refining.',1356,1,1e35,0.15,0,333,NULL,25.14,0,519,0),(1229,467,'Gneiss','Gneiss is a popular ore type because it holds a bit of many minerals, increasing its utility value. It has a little something of tritanium, mexallon, isogen and zydrine. It has a portion size of 400 ore units for refining.',1377,1,1e35,5,0,400,NULL,653.54,0,525,0),(1230,462,'Veldspar','The most common ore type in the known world, Veldspar can be found most everywhere. It is still in constant supply as it holds a large portion of the much-used tritanium mineral. It requires 333 ore units to refine.',232,1,4000,0.1,0,333,NULL,8.68,0,518,0),(1231,455,'Hemorphite','With a large portion of nocxium the Hemorphite is always a good find. It is common enough that even novice miners can expect to run into it. Hemorphite also has a bit of tritanium and isogen. It requires 500 ore units to refine.',1282,1,1e35,3,0,500,NULL,674.44,0,528,0),(1232,453,'Dark Ochre','Dark Ochre was for years ignored as a worthwile ore to mine until improved refining techniques managed to extract the huge amount of nocxium inside it, the highest ratio of nocxium found in any ore in the world. 400 ore units of Dark Ochre are needed to refine it.',1275,1,1e35,8,0,400,NULL,1518.34,0,522,0),(1233,25,'Enigma','The mysterious Enigma.',1010,38,1000000,20400,600,1,NULL,0,1,0,0.07),(1236,78,'Overdrive Injector System II','This monster unit vastly increases engine power at the expense of cargo capacity.',1040,100,100,5,0,1,NULL,45623.84,0,132,0.06),(1237,158,'Overdrive Injector System II Blueprint','',1040,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,9999999,1,0,0),(1240,78,'Basic Reinforced Bulkheads','Increases structural hit points while reducing agility and overall top speed.',1038,100,200,5,0,1,NULL,11950,1,135,0.07),(1241,158,'Basic Reinforced Bulkheads Blueprint','',1038,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,50000,0,335,0),(1242,78,'Basic Nanofiber Internal Structure','Replaces some of the heavier structure components with lighter, but