s have this compound in relative short supply and hence must rely on starship freight.',1178,0,250,0.25,0,1,NULL,35,1,492,0),(3647,280,'Holoreels','Holo-Vid reels are the most common type of personal entertainment there is. From interactive gaming to erotic motion pictures, these reels can contain hundreds of titles each.',1177,0,100,0.5,0,1,NULL,250,1,492,0),(3651,54,'Basic Miner','Common, low technology mining laser. Works well for extracting common ore, but not useful for much else.',1061,25,0,5,0,1,NULL,0,1,138,0.07),(3652,134,'Basic Miner Blueprint','',1061,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,9999999,1,0,0),(3653,63,'Medium Hull Repairer I','Makes use of nano-assembler technology in order to repair damage done to the structure.',80,0,1000,10,0,1,NULL,147471.04,1,538,0.07),(3654,143,'Medium Hull Repairer I Blueprint','',194,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,1250000,1,334,0),(3655,63,'Medium Hull Repairer II','Makes use of nano-assembler technology in order to repair damage done to the structure.',80,0,1000,10,0,1,NULL,226771.96,0,538,0.06),(3656,143,'Medium Hull Repairer II Blueprint','',194,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,9999999,1,0,0),(3663,63,'Large Hull Repairer I','Makes use of nano-assembler technology in order to repair damage done to the structure.',80,0,1000,50,0,1,NULL,210584.38,0,538,0.07),(3664,143,'Large Hull Repairer I Blueprint','',194,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,3125000,1,334,0),(3665,63,'Large Hull Repairer II','Makes use of nano-assembler technology in order to repair damage done to the structure.',80,0,1000,50,0,1,NULL,152604.76,0,538,0.06),(3666,143,'Large Hull Repairer II Blueprint','',194,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,9999999,1,0,0),(3673,280,'Wheat','Cereal grasses have been localized on hundreds of worlds. The grains of the wheat plant make a solid foundation for the production of foodstuffs within empire space.',1182,0,1000,1.15,0,1,NULL,100,1,492,0),(3683,280,'Oxygen','Oxygen is a commodity in constant demand. While most stations have their own supply units, smaller depots and space crafts rely on imports.',1183,0,1.4,1,0,1,NULL,95,1,20,0),(3685,280,'Hydrogen Batteries','Using hydrogen batteries in industry as well as common power supply has become an international standard on off-world habitats such as space stations.',1184,0,1500,1,0,1,NULL,500,1,20,0),(3687,280,'Electronic Parts','These basic elements of all electronic hardware are sought out by those who require spare parts in their hardware. Factories and manufacturers take these parts and assemble them into finished products, which are then sold on the market.',1185,0,1000,1,0,1,NULL,750,1,20,0),(3689,280,'Mechanical Parts','These basic elements of all mechanical hardware are sought out by those who require spare parts in their machinery. Factories and manufacturers take these parts and assemble them into finished products, which are then sold on the market.',1186,0,2000,1,0,1,NULL,600,1,20,0),(3691,280,'Synthetic Oil','Since original oil can only be harvested from a world with a long biological history, synthetic oil has become frequently produced in laboratories all over known space.',1187,0,500,0.5,0,1,NULL,320,1,20,0),(3693,280,'Fertilizer','Fertilizer is particularly valued on agricultural worlds, where there is constant supply for all commodities that boost export value.',1188,0,3000,2,0,1,NULL,200,1,20,0),(3695,280,'Polytextiles','This synthetic fabric is used for clothing as well as makeshift shelters on hard-climate colonies.',1189,0,200,1,0,1,NULL,400,1,20,0),(3697,280,'Silicate Glass','The silicate glass is a common construction material, in constant demand throughout the civilized world.',1190,0,1200,1,0,1,NULL,185,1,20,0),(3699,280,'Quafe','Quafe is the name of the most popular soft drink in the universe, manufactured by a Gallentean company bearing the same name. Like so many soft drinks, it was initially intended as a medicine for indigestion and tender stomachs, but the refreshing effects of the drink appealed to everyone and the drink quickly became tremendously popular. Quafe is one of the best recognized brands in the whole EVE universe and can be found in every corner of it.',1191,0,500,0.1,0,1,NULL,50,1,492,0),(3701,314,'Certification Results','These complicated certification results may mean little to the layman\'s eye, but can prove valuable in the right hands.',1192,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,0,0,0,0),(3703,313,'Nerve Sticks','This booster is used as a stress-reliever and is ingested with a sip of water.',1193,0,10,0.2,0,1,NULL,2500,1,491,0),(3705,313,'Crash','This expensive booster is highly addictive and has been known to cause heart attacks and seizures.',1194,0,5,0.2,0,1,NULL,1100,1,491,0),(3707,313,'Blue Pill','This booster causes forgetfulness and bliss, and may cause light hallucinations.',1195,0,10,0.2,0,1,NULL,2200,1,491,0),(3709,313,'Drop','This highly hallucinogenic booster can easily cause temporary dementia. It is commonly poured into a wet rag, which is then laid over, or bound across, sensitive parts of the skin.',1196,0,5,0.2,0,1,NULL,1000,1,491,0),(3711,313,'X-Instinct','Abusers of this booster have reported surreal visions and altered perceptions of the world around them. The subject becomes blissful and content, but highly analytical of the surroundings.',1206,0,800,1,0,1,NULL,13500,1,491,0),(3713,313,'Vitoc','The Vitoc booster has become more than a simple strategy by the Amarrians in controling their slaves. With the Vitoc method, slaves are injected with a toxic chemical substance that is fatal unless the recipient receives a constant supply of an antidote. The method first appeared a few centuries ago when the Amarrians started manning some of their space ships with slaves. As space crew the slaves had to be cajoled into doing complex, often independent work, making older methods of slave control undesirable. Although the more conventional ways of subduing slaves with force (actual or threat of) are still widely used in other forced labor areas, the Vitoc method has proven itself admirably for the fleet.',1207,0,800,0.5,0,1,NULL,9300,1,491,0),(3715,281,'Frozen Food','Frozen food is in high demand in many regions, especially on stations orbiting a non-habitable planet and a long way from an agricultural world.',30,0,400,0.5,0,1,NULL,98,1,492,0),(3717,281,'Dairy Products','These products, extracted from livestock, are one of the biggest cogs in the food production cycle. Dairy products are rich with calcium and help make sure the inhabitants of the EVE universe all have shiny teeth.',1198,0,400,0.5,0,1,NULL,160,1,492,0),(3719,283,'Tourists','The need for tasting other cultures and seeing new worlds is unquenchable among the well-off citizens of the universe.',2539,0,200,1,0,1,NULL,100,1,23,0),(3721,283,'Slaves','Slavery has always been a questionable industry, favored by the Amarr Empire and detested by the Gallente Federation.',2541,0,200,3,0,1,NULL,750,1,23,0),(3723,283,'Slaver Hound','The slaver hound is a native animal of Syrikos V and has been bred by the Amarrians from the time they first settled the planet more than a millennium ago. The favorable experience of employing the slaver hound as a guard animal has led to it being exported from Syrikos V to most other Amarrian agricultural planets and even some industrial and mining ones as well. In recent years, the slaver hound has become fashionable among Amarrians as pet for those willing to risk its often murderous nature; slaver hounds can become extremely loyal and devoted to their owners if handled with care.',1180,0,30,1,0,1,NULL,3000,1,23,0),(3725,283,'Livestock','Livestock are domestic animals raised for home use or for profit, whether it be for their meat or dairy products.',1205,0,900,1,0,1,NULL,850,1,23,0),(3727,282,'Plutonium','Plutonium is used in arms manufacturing, among other things, making it a steady trade commodity.',29,0,2000,1,0,1,NULL,12000,1,22,0),(3729,282,'Toxic Waste','Waste from various production industries and arms manufacturers can be hazardous to the environment, but instead of dumping it to the void, it can be 