orrosion inhibitor and a superconductor.',2578,0,8800,0.8,1,1,NULL,2500,1,501,0),(16650,427,'Dysprosium','A relatively rare soft metal, easily dissolvable in mineral acids.  Used primarily in the production of laser materials.',2571,0,8550,1,1,1,NULL,6000,1,501,0),(16651,427,'Neodymium','A rare, silvery metal.  Due to its atmospheric reactiveness, Neodymium is used primarily for light-refractive purposes and as a colorant for other materials.',2574,0,7010,1,1,1,NULL,6000,1,501,0),(16652,427,'Promethium','An extremely radioactive luminsescent metal, sometimes used as a heating component and a building block for laser generators.',2576,0,7260,1,1,1,NULL,6000,1,501,0),(16653,427,'Thulium','A soft, rare, silvery-gray metal.  Used in the creation of lasers, in addition to possessing a range of radiation-related production applications.',2579,0,9320,1,1,1,NULL,6000,1,501,0),(16654,428,'Titanium Chromide','Titanium Chromide is in high demand among technicians and manufacturers for its unique combination of strength, light weight and catalytic potential.',2664,0,0,1,0,1,NULL,2382,1,500,0),(16655,428,'Crystallite Alloy','A polynuclear heterometallic compound created from cobalt and cadmium.  Crystallite alloys are a fundamental building block in the creation of crystalline composites.',2664,0,0,1,0,1,NULL,2382,1,500,0),(16656,428,'Fernite Alloy','An intensely durable and extremely versatile alloy, Fernite, when combined with certain other materials, is a crucial stepping stone in the creation of a whole host of advanced technologies.',2664,0,0,1,0,1,NULL,2382,1,500,0),(16657,428,'Rolled Tungsten Alloy','An extremely strong compound, made from tungsten rolled in a sheath of platinum.  A crucial component in the creation of carbides which have a wide field of utility in the manufacture of various equipment.',2664,0,0,1,0,1,NULL,2382,1,500,0),(16658,428,'Silicon Diborite','A mineral composite which, in large quantities, gives off a distinct crystalline glow.  When combined with