pital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers.  Nuclear weapons are considered by most races to be crude and primitive. However, the Minmatar still favor them over more sophisticated weapons due to the abundance of materials for plutonium production in Minmatar space.',2831,10,1,0.35,0,100,NULL,721.65,1,502,0.07),(17673,165,'Nuclear XL Blueprint','',1304,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,3000000,1,597,0),(17674,83,'Phased Plasma XL','Extra Large Projectile Ammo.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. This ammo uses a similar plasma containment core as hybrid charges except that it is mounted in a standard cannon shell.',2832,10,1,0.425,0,100,NULL,1807.24,1,502,0.07),(17675,165,'Phased Plasma XL Blueprint','',1305,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,8000000,1,597,0),(17676,83,'Proton XL','Extra Large Projectile Ammo.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. Emits a focused, high intensity proton burst upon impact. Fairly effective vs. both shields and armor.',2833,10,1,0.3,0,100,NULL,1142.1,1,502,0.07),(17677,165,'Proton XL Blueprint','',1306,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,4000000,1,597,0),(17678,83,'Titanium Sabot XL','Extra Large Projectile Ammo.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. This is among the most feared ammunition around. It has excellent penetration. Once the ship\'s outer layer is penetrated, the core explodes, spraying the interior with a cloud of fragmentation flechettes that cause considerable damage to the vulnerable interior structure.',2834,10,1,0.325,0,100,NULL,1456.68,1,502,0.07),(17679,165,'Titanium Sabot XL Blueprint','',1307,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,6000000,1,597,0),(17680,86,'Gamma XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the gamma frequencies. Greatly reduced range. Greatly increased damage.',1139,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,1526505.75,1,503,0.07),(17681,168,'Gamma XL Blueprint','',1139,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,35000000,1,599,0),(17682,86,'Infrared XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the infrared frequencies. Slightly improved range.',1144,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,494226.25,1,503,0.07),(17683,168,'Infrared XL Blueprint','',1144,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,10000000,1,599,0),(17684,86,'Microwave XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the microwave frequencies. Improved range.',1143,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,888217.75,1,503,0.07),(17685,168,'Microwave XL Blueprint','',1143,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,20000000,1,599,0),(17686,86,'Multifrequency XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nRandomly cycles the laser through the entire spectrum. Vastly reduced range. Vastly increased damage.',1131,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,1702150.75,1,503,0.07),(17687,168,'Multifrequency XL Blueprint','',1131,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,40000000,1,599,0),(17688,86,'Radio XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the radio frequencies. Greatly improved range.',1145,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,1422550.25,1,503,0.07),(17689,168,'Radio XL Blueprint','',1145,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,30000000,1,599,0),(17690,86,'Standard XL','Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts and carriers. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the visible light spectrum.',1142,1,1,1,0,1,NULL,570395.62,1,503,0.07),(17691,168,'Standard XL Blueprint','',1142,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,12500000,1,599,0),(1