calized especially in cell nuclei, and are constructed of a double helix held together by hydrogen bonds between purine and pyrimidine bases which project inward from two chains containing alternate links of deoxyribose and phosphate.\r\n\r\nThis DNA sample is taken from the notorious Angel Cartel Commander, Black Jack.',2302,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25365,715,'Oronata Vion\'s Caracal','Oronata Vion\'s Caracal',2637,221.05,10100000,101000,250,1,1,0,1,0,0),(25366,409,'Oronata Vion\'s Insignia','Identification tags such as these may prove valuable if handed to the proper organization.',2040,0,0.1,0.1,0,1,8,750000,1,0,0),(25367,526,'Kois Entry Passcard','Kois Entry Passcard',2038,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25368,715,'Guristas War Installation_Airkio Yanjulen','This gigantic suprastructure is one of the military installations of the Guristas pirate corporation. Even for its size it has no commercial station services or docking bays to receive guests.',2781,11433,100000,100000000,10000,1,1,0,1,0,0),(25369,526,'Airkio Yanjulen\'s Corpse','The corpse of the Guristas officer Airkio Yanjulen.',2855,0,80,1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25371,715,'Radio Telescope_Tomi_Hakiro','This huge radio telescope contains fragile but advanced sensory equipment. A structure such as this has enormous capabilities in crunching survey data from nearby systems and constellations.',2505,3475,100000,100000000,10000,1,2,0,1,0,0),(25372,409,'Tomi Hakiro\'s Insignia','Identification tags such as these may prove valuable if handed to the proper organization.',2040,0,0.1,0.1,0,1,8,20000,1,0,0),(25373,283,'Militants','A combative character; aggressive, especially in the service of a cause.',2540,0,1000,2,0,1,NULL,1000,1,0,0),(25374,287,'Mutated Drone Parasite','Rogue drones are hi-tech drones that have the ability to manufacture themselves. Rogue drone hives can be found throughout the universe of EVE and are a constant menace to space travelers. Threat level: Deadly',1718,250,101000000,1010000,950,1,8,0,1,0,0),(25375,226,'LCO Guristas Control Tower','Originally designed by the Kaalakiota, the Caldari Control Tower blueprint was quickly obtained by the Guristas, through their agents within the State, to serve their own needs.',2370,3275,0,0,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25377,494,'Akkeshu\'s Storage Facility','Storage silos are much more secure and durable than their Secure Container counterparts. They are usually the focus of attacks on outposts and commonly contain ore, refined minerals or valuable items waiting to be transported to empire space.',2301,911,1000000,1150,8850,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25378,474,'Drone Modified Passcard','The data within this chip unlocks the acceleration gate leading to a deadspace area behind the infamous Cadaver Reef. The accesscards are singe-use.',2038,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25379,287,'Anti-Stabilizer Drone','Rogue drones are hi-tech drones that have the ability to manufacture themselves. Rogue drone hives can be found throughout the universe of EVE and are a constant menace to space travelers. Threat level: Deadly',1718,250,101000000,1010000,950,1,8,0,1,0,0),(25380,88,'Defender test','Defensive missile used to destroy incoming missiles.',192,25,10,0.03,0,100,NULL,0,1,0,0.07),(25381,170,'Defender test Blueprint','',192,0,0,0.01,0,1,NULL,150000,1,0,0),(25382,314,'Guristas War Plans','Guristas War Plans',2355,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,100,1,0,0),(25383,526,'Otsalen Mano\'s Corpse','The corpse of the Caldari agenet Otsalen Mano lies mangled inside one of the ejected capsules.  Upon closer examination, a map has been madly scribbled on a piece of cloth torn from his garments.  Perhaps these are the Guristas War Plans he had discovered?',2855,0,80,1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25384,494,'Shielded Prison Facility','Smaller confined shield generators with their own access restrictions can be deployed outside the Control Tower\'s defense perimeter. This allows for lesser security areas around the Starbase, for purposes of storage or pickup.',2380,1229,1,1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25385,383,'H-2874 Defense Sentinel','An unstable yet extremely powerful Guristas 425mm railgun sentry',2418,340,1000,1000,1000,1,1,0,1,0,0),(25386,474,'Prison Area Pass','This security passcard is manufactured by the Guristas Pirates, and allows the user to access the Prison grounds connected with the Iacta Space Plain in O-LR1H.',2038,0,1,0.1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25387,526,'Guristas Armory Codes','These complicated data sheets may mean little to the layman\'s eye, but can prove valuable in the right hands.',1192,0,1,1,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(25388,494,'Guristas_Small Armory','This small armory has a thick layer of reinforced tritanium and a customized shield module for deflecting incoming fire.',2372,1045,100000,100000000,10000,1,1,0,1,0,0),(25389,0,'#System','',NULL,0,0,0,0,1,NULL,0,1,0,0),(29001,30,'Soltueur','The Gallente Federation\'s first-generation Iapetan-class titan, the Soltueur \�\�\� \"Sun Slayer\" \�\�\� was conceived during the Caldari-Gallente War as the ultimate deterrent. Dwarfing even the modern Erebus-class, the Soltueur was designed to end wars by its mere presence. Only a handful were ever constructed, and one was famously hijacked by Salvador Sarpati and renamed the FNS Molleneux.\n\nGallente Titan Skill Bonuses:\n10% bonus to Capital Hybrid Turret damage per level\n7.5% bonus to gang members\' maximum armor HP per level\nImmune to all forms of Electronic Warfare',329,14000,3500000000,300000000,130000,1,8,0,1,0,0),(29002,30,'Omnya','The Caldari State\'s first-generation Iapetan-class titan. The Omnya was constructed near the end of the Caldari-Gallente War as the State\'s answer to the Gallente Soltueur program. Few details survive about its operational history; what remains in the modern era are only ripped superstructures \�\�\� twisted hulks drifting as monuments to an age of unrestrained ambition.\n\nCaldari Titan Skill Bonuses:\n5% bonus to Citadel Missile kinetic damage per level\n5% bonus to Citadel Launcher rate of fire per level\nImmune to all forms of Electronic Warfare',3039,12000,3600000000,270000000,110000,1,1,0,0,0,0),(29003,30,'Leviathan Iapetan','The Minmatar tribes\' first-generation Iapetan-class titan. Used by the Thukker tribe as mobile colonies, these enormous vessels required such vast resources that their construction ultimately drove the Minmatar to invest in smaller, more practical Promethean-class successors. The few that survived became nomadic homes for entire Thukker caravans, drifting between the stars.\n\nMinmatar Titan Skill Bonuses:\n5% bonus to Capital Projectile Turret rate of fire per level\n5% bonus to Capital Projectile Turret damage per level\nImmune to all forms of Electronic Warfare',1239,16000,3100000000,200000000,120000,1,2,0,1,0,0),(29004,30,'Imud Hubrau','The Amarr Empire\'s first-generation Iapetan-class titan, the Imud Hubrau \�\�\� \"Beast of Heaven.\" Two were constructed; one was famously seized by King Khanid II during his secession from the Empire. The other is rumored to serve as the Emperor Ship itself, a vessel of such religious and military significance that its very existence is considered a state secret.\n\nAmarr Titan Skill Bonuses:\n10% reduction in Capital Energy Turret capacitor use per level\n5% bonus to Capital Energy Turret damage per level\nImmune to all forms of Electronic Warfare',2107,13000,3400000000,310000000,90000,1,4,0,0,0,0);
